      "slug": "gram:itashimasu",
      "nuance_tags": ["humility", "politeness"],
      "usage_contexts": ["business", "formal-email", "spoken"],
      "steps_unavailable": "いたします is the suppletive humble counterpart of する, not a productive suffix. The productive pattern in the record is お／ご + VERBAL NOUN + いたします (ご連絡いたします): it needs a prefix operation the op enum lacks and a suru-verbal-noun base the base enum lacks. Base noun + append いたします would license 学生いたします; base verb + replace-ending would license 書いたします.",
